        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Isabella I of Castile</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1451 CE – 1504 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">22 April 1451 (Maundy Thursday) at Madrigal de las Altas Torres; daughter of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/john-king-of-england">King John</a> II of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-castile">Castile</a> and of his second wife, Isabella of Portugal</span></div>
